---
title: 电商系统架构
---
graph TD
  用户[用户浏览器] --> CDN
  CDN -->|HTTPS| GW(API 网关)
  subgraph 后端服务
    GW --> order[订单服务]
    GW --> user[用户服务]
    GW --> goods[商品服务]
    order --> MQ[(消息队列)]
  end
  subgraph 数据层
    order --> DB[(MySQL)]
    user --> DB
    goods --> Cache{{Redis 缓存}}
    goods --> DB
  end
  MQ --> worker[异步 Worker]
  worker --> DB
  监控[Prometheus 监控] -.-> order
  监控 -.-> user
